config FREETZ_LIB_libsoapysdr
	bool "soapysdr (libSoapySDR.so)"
	depends on FREETZ_TARGET_UCLIBC_1_0_58_MIN
	default n
	help
		SoapySDR is a vendor and platform neutral SDR support library and
		API. Hardware support is not part of it: it is provided by
		loadable modules (e.g. soapyrtlsdr for RTL-SDR dongles) that have
		to be installed below /usr/lib/SoapySDR/modules0.8.

		Used by rtl_433 as an alternative input besides librtlsdr.

		Resolution uClibc 1.0.58 or newer (SoapySDR needs a C++11 capable
		toolchain).

		https://github.com/pothosware/SoapySDR
